{"id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#def:dc-ch6-3-normal-connection","title":"def:dc-ch6-3-normal-connection","path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions.md","line":400,"body":"","kind":"definition","status":"not_started","tex":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions.tex#def:dc-ch6-3-normal-connection","uses":["[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#def:dc-ch6-2-patch]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#def:dc-ch6-2-B]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions.tex","label":"def:dc-ch6-3-normal-connection","line":898,"source":"\\begin{definition}[shape operator and normal connection: the Weingarten decomposition]\n  \\label{def:dc-ch6-3-normal-connection}\n\n  \\uses{def:dc-ch6-2-patch, def:dc-ch6-2-B}\n\n  For fields $X$, $\\eta$ on the patch set\n  $S_\\eta(X)=-(\\overline{\\nabla}_X\\eta)^T$ (the \\emph{shape operator}, tangent\n  valued) and $\\nabla^\\perp_X\\eta=(\\overline{\\nabla}_X\\eta)^N$ (the \\emph{normal\n  connection}, normal valued), so that equation (5) reads\n\n  $$\n  \\overline{\\nabla}_X\\eta=-S_\\eta(X)+\\nabla^\\perp_X\\eta.\n  $$\n\\end{definition}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Definition</div></section>[shape operator and normal connection: the Weingarten decomposition] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6465663a64632d6368362d332d6e6f726d616c2d636f6e6e656374696f6e\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh06_IsometricImmersions%23def%3Adc-ch6-2-patch\">↗ def:dc-ch6-2-patch</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh06_IsometricImmersions%23def%3Adc-ch6-2-B\">↗ def:dc-ch6-2-B</a> <p></p>For fields <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$X$\">$X$</span>, <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\eta $\">$\\eta $</span> on the patch set <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$S_\\eta (X)=-(\\overline{\\nabla }_X\\eta )^T$\">$S_\\eta (X)=-(\\overline{\\nabla }_X\\eta )^T$</span> (the <em>shape operator</em>, tangent valued) and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\nabla ^\\perp _X\\eta =(\\overline{\\nabla }_X\\eta )^N$\">$\\nabla ^\\perp _X\\eta =(\\overline{\\nabla }_X\\eta )^N$</span> (the <em>normal connection</em>, normal valued), so that equation (5) reads <p></p><span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  \\overline{\\nabla }_X\\eta =-S_\\eta (X)+\\nabla ^\\perp _X\\eta .  \\]\">\\[  \\overline{\\nabla }_X\\eta =-S_\\eta (X)+\\nabla ^\\perp _X\\eta .  \\]</span> ","warnings":[]},"previous":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#def:dc-ch6-2-10","next":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#prop:dc-ch6-3-normal-connection-laws","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#def:dc-ch6-2-patch","title":"def:dc-ch6-2-patch","label":"def:dc-ch6-2-patch"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#def:dc-ch6-2-B","title":"def:dc-ch6-2-B","label":"def:dc-ch6-2-B"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#def:dc-ch6-2-2","title":"def:dc-ch6-2-2","label":"def:dc-ch6-2-2"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#prop:dc-ch6-2-3","title":"prop:dc-ch6-2-3","label":"prop:dc-ch6-2-3"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch06_IsometricImmersions#prop:dc-ch6-3-normal-connection-laws","title":"prop:dc-ch6-3-normal-connection-laws","label":"prop:dc-ch6-3-normal-connection-laws"},{"kind":"